cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use these notebooks or reports, please cite them as below.

type: software

title: "SA_Management: Management and Curation of EarthPortal Resources"

version: "v0.3.0"

date-released: "2026-10-29"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23417011"

abstract: >-
  Jupyter notebooks that build a dated state of the art of the semantic
  artefacts hosted on EarthPortal: they collect the catalogue through the
  EarthPortal API, read the O'FAIRe scores, compare the metadata with the
  OntoPortal Metadata Guideline and write one audit page per artefact.
  The repository also holds short reports written during an internship
  at CNRS / Data Terra.

